{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".strict"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deallocation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"assertNoPendingEvents()"},{"type":"text","text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isolated ","type":"text"},{"code":"deinit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to an ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown test"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rather than to the test that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each test with an explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It runs the strict check with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/off","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/strict"],"title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","title":"TestExhaustivity","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TestExhaustivity.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/InnoSquadCorp\/InnoRouter\/blob\/5.2.1\/Sources\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity.swift#L25"},"symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"externalID":"s:17InnoRouterTesting16TestExhaustivityO"},"abstra